# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# PROJECT RULES (from the PDD: risks R5/R6 and the ethics section)
# This repository is PUBLIC. It holds code and aggregate results only.
# Never commit raw command histories, volunteered data, participant
# data, consent forms or secrets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Datasets and anything derived from individual histories
data/*
